body:
I'm trying to toggleRefinement multiple values while creating a custom widget:
```
...
init: function init(options) {
   var helper = options.helper;
   helper.toggleRefinement(attributeName, ['facet1,facet2']);
}
...
```
But they are returning no results, can you not use conjunctive faceting of the same category with multiple values?

comments.body:
Also, @Giovanni-Mattucci if your attributes are not storing arrays you will have to do this:

```js
helper.toggleRefinement(attributeName, 'value1');
helper.toggleRefinement(attributeName, 'value2');
```

Please reopen the issue if that's not what you were looking for
